{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2022-07-25 07:00:00', 'title': 'NORTHROP GRUMMAN SUCCESSFULLY IDENTIFIES MODERN THREATS DURING ADVANCED MISSILE FLIGHT TEST', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, JULY 25, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION (NYSE: NOC) SUCCESSFULLY COMPLETED THE THIRD CAPTIVE FLIGHT TEST OF ITS PROTOTYPE MISSILE DEVELOPMENT SERIES. THE INTERNALLY FUNDED AIR-LAUNCHED MISSILE DEMONSTRATES CAPABILITIES RELEVANT FOR MULTIPLE SERVICES, MISSIONS AND PLATFORMS.'}